<view class="page device-page"><view class="device"><view class="screen"><view class="screen-top"><view><text class="brand">先吃 FIRST BITE</text><text class="date">{{date}}</text></view><view class="battery">▰▰▰</view></view><view class="ink-buddy"><lingling-character size="small" mood="{{mood}}"/><text>{{message}}</text></view><view class="divider"></view><text class="screen-title">今天优先吃</text><view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="screen-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><text class="num">0{{index+1}}</text><view><text class="food">{{item.name}}</text><text class="meta">剩余 {{item.remainingQuantity}}{{item.unit}} · {{item.priority}}</text></view></view></view><view wx:else class="screen-empty"><text>冰箱空空的</text><text>今天也要好好吃饭</text></view><view class="screen-bottom">看一眼，再开门。<text>↗</text></view></view><view class="magnet m1"></view><view class="magnet m2"></view></view><text class="sync-time">本地模拟 · 最近同步 {{synced}}</text><button class="btn sync" bindtap="sync">同步小程序库存</button><view class="tip">当前为黑白墨水屏显示模拟。已预留设备服务接口，暂不连接真实硬件。</view></view>
